    "Summary": "Provides host-local administration storage, authenticated identities and explicit owners for dedicated servers.",
    "Description": "Provides console and platform-chat administration, host-local records and explicit owners inside one C# library. Add one Superuser Bootstrap to your game's network scene and explicitly enable its editor switch for testing. Permissions, managed modules, typed dispatch and durable audit records are included. Custom chat, moderation and visual admin UI remain pending.",
